\fs28\b FurEver Care - Project ReadMe\b0\fs22\par
\par
\b Run instructions\b0\par
Open the FurEverCare_Project folder with VS Code Live Server, or run: python -m http.server 8000. Then browse to http://localhost:8000.\par
\par
\b Technologies\b0\par
HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap, JavaScript, jQuery, JSON/TXT and XML.\par
\par
\b Assumptions\b0\par
No backend or server-side storage is used. Product purchase and appointment slots are display-only. Contact numbers and prices are demo values. External maps, video and photographs require internet access unless photographs have been downloaded using tools/download_images.py.\par
\par
\b Main documentation\b0\par
See README.md, PROJECT_REPORT.md, SRS_COMPLIANCE.md and the SVG diagrams inside docs.\par
}
